OL,3,ADolly Parton's sister pleads for end to
OL,4,A'AI garbage' posts after singer's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton's sister has issued a plea
OL,7,Fto fans over "fake AI garbage" posted
OL,8,Fon social media in the wake of the
OL,9,Fsinger's death.
OL,11,FTributes to the late country legend
OL,12,Fhave appeared online and at locations
OL,13,Fincluding the Country Music Hall of
OL,14,FFame in Nashville, after Parton died on
OL,15,F25 August at the age of 80.
OL,17,FWriting on Instagram, Stella Parton
OL,18,Fthanked those who had shown "genuine
OL,19,Fsupport" for the star and her family -
OL,20,Fbut said a "tremendous amount of AI and
OL,21,Fendless garbage being posted" had been
OL,22,F"challenging to absorb".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
